  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Take a print from the camera\n\n3. Input text (Screenshot 1) (doesn't actually make a difference)\n\n4. Other user saves print in gallery (Screenshot 2\n\n5. Owner removes print from world (Screenshot 3)\n\n6. Owner deletes picture from gallery (Screenshot 4)\n\n7. Other user tries printing the deleted picture and their client won't let them print any other pictures (the print button is blacked out) regardless of ownership. The user can't also delete their copy but can delete other pictures.\n\nThis can only be fixed by restarting the client.\n\nError logs can be found in the screenshots. (Screenshot 5)",
